---
import { DEPLOYMENT } from '@/lib/deployment'
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { Header } from '@/components/layout/Header'
import { Footer } from '@/components/layout/Footer'
import '@/styles/global.css'
---
<BaseLayout title="Help shape Queensland | Fusion Party Queensland" description="Explore ten issues facing Queensland, read Fusion's national policy foundations and help develop Queensland's response.">
<Header />
<main id="main-content" class="qld-home">
<header class="hero"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Fusion Queensland · Your state, your ideas</p><h1>What should Queensland <em>do differently?</em></h1><p>Explore the issues. See what Queensland can change. Help shape the solutions.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#issues">Explore the 10 issues ↓</a><a href="/contact">Share an idea →</a></div><small>These are starting points for discussion, not adopted Queensland policies.</small></div></header>
<section id="issues" class="section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Ten starting points</p><h2>What matters to you?</h2><p class="lead">Each issue crosses federal and state responsibilities. Read Fusion's national position, then tell us what Queensland should do.</p><div class="issues"><article class="issue"><span class="num">01 / 10</span><h3>Housing people can afford</h3><p>Homes should be secure and within reach.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/housing_as_a_home" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">02 / 10</span><h3>Healthcare when you need it</h3><p>Better access to care, wherever you live.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/fair_inclusive_society" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">03 / 10</span><h3>Better mental health services</h3><p>Earlier support and coordinated care.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/fair_inclusive_society" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">04 / 10</span><h3>Public education and TAFE</h3><p>Give people the skills and opportunities to thrive.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/education_for_life" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">05 / 10</span><h3>Cost of living and poverty</h3><p>Make essentials more affordable.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/fair_inclusive_society" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">06 / 10</span><h3>Clean, reliable energy</h3><p>Affordable power and a sustainable future.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/climate_rescue" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">07 / 10</span><h3>Transport that keeps up</h3><p>Connect communities as they grow.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/policy-principles" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">08 / 10</span><h3>Protect our environment</h3><p>Restore nature and safeguard shared resources.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/ecological_restoration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">09 / 10</span><h3>Transparent government</h3><p>Make public decisions open to scrutiny.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/ethical_governance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article>
<article class="issue"><span class="num">10 / 10</span><h3>Communities having a say</h3><p>Give people a voice before decisions are made.</p><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/our_party" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National policy ↗</a><a href="/contact">Share your perspective →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section alternate"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Follow the evidence</p><h2>Queensland investigations</h2><p class="lead">Questions worth examining, evidence worth sharing. Investigations are not adopted party policy.</p><a class="primary" href="/investigations">Explore investigations →</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Help build the response</p><h2>Your experience matters.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us what is happening in your community, what should change and what evidence we should examine. Contributions inform discussion; they are not automatically endorsed as policy.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="/contact">Send your recommendation →</a><a href="https://www.fusionparty.org.au/policy">Read national policies ↗</a></div></div></section>
</main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.qld-home{color:var(--color-fg,#233d3a);background:#fffaf3}.shell{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:0 1.5rem}.hero{background:#233d3a;color:#fff7ec;padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,9rem) 0}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:800;color:#8fe0c8;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);line-height:1.05;max-width:900px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#f4cd75}.hero p{font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.5vw,1.5rem);max-width:650px;margin:2rem 0}.actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:2rem 0}.actions a,.primary{display:inline-block;padding:1rem 1.4rem;font-weight:800;border:2px solid currentColor;text-decoration:none}.actions .primary,.primary{background:#731e32;color:#fff7ec;border-color:#731e32}.hero .primary{background:#fff7ec;color:#233d3a;border-color:#fff7ec}.hero small{display:block;opacity:.8}.section{padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem) 0}.section .eyebrow{color:#137c71}.section h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.1}.lead{font-size:1.2rem;max-width:740px;margin:1.5rem 0 2.5rem}.issues{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,280px),1fr));gap:1rem}.issue{background:white;border:1px solid #ddd5d8;border-radius:14px;padding:1.8rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}.issue .num{color:#731e32;font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem}.issue h3{font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800}.issue p{flex:1;color:#53505a}.issue a{font-weight:800;color:#14796e}.alternate{background:#f0e9f3}
</style>